run in the 100. In full sight of 100,000 Germans, including " [:a {:href "/athletes/1100010"} "Adolf Hitler"] ", Dörffeldt dropped the baton. Stephens ran a stunning anchor leg and some thought she may have been able to catch Dörffeldt, but that was not needed, as the Germans did not finish. Dörffeldt broke down crying on the track and Hitler called the entire relay team up to his booth to comfort them."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} "United States"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "47.1 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "46.9 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "10"} [:a {:href "/athletes/77760"} "Harriet Bland"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/77955"} "Annette Rogers"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/77953"} "Betty Robinson"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/77976"} "Helen Stephens"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/923113"} "Olive Hasenfus"] [:small {} " (DNS)"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/923148"} "Louise Stokes"] [:small {} " (DNS)"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/77928"} "Anne O'Brien"] [:small {} " (DNS)"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/923232"} "Jo Warren"] [:small {} " (DNS)"]]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} "Great Britain"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "GBR"]] [:td {} "47.5 (2 h2)"] [:td {} "47.6 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "10"} [:a